  - cargo test --workspace passed with 44 tests after quantized decoded-shadow removal.
  - tools/vs/Test-TinyRustLM.ps1 -BrowserSmoke -BrowserSmokePort 8094 -PortSearchLimit 10 passed after quantized decoded-shadow removal; it rebuilt WASM, ran all model/manifests/source/eval/ABI gates, q8/q4 browser generation, loop, malformed, context, missing-model, endurance, performance, and desktop/mobile UI audit.
